@startuml
[*] --> State

state Unassigned
Unassigned --> Assigned : assign staff member to client or campaign
Assigned --> Unassigned : remove assignment from staff member
Assigned --> Switched : enable staff member to switch between assignments
Switched --> Assigned : return to previous assignment
State --> Unemployed : mark staff member as unemployed when they leave the job
Unemployed --> Archived : archive record of former employee after some time has passed

State --> [*]
@enduml
